</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 6:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->01/15/1974 <BR>Police called to 803N.Edgemoor in Wichita Kansas <BR>Home of Joseph and Julie Otero <BR>four homicides &#40;murders&#41; found <BR>Joseph Otero age 38 <BR>Julie Otero age 34 <BR>Josephine age 11 <BR>Joseph age 9 <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
