</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 6:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Brought to Scene  venetian blind cord  <BR>Taken from scene Joes watch, the car,  a 1966 beige oldsmobile vista cruser station wagon found later at Dillons on the corner of Oliver and Central. <BR> <BR>First respondant Officer Gary Caldwell<!--/Text--></td></tr>
