</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 7:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Joe: <BR>Position: Southwest bedroom, feet tie to the bed, Head pointed in a southerly direction. <BR>Bondage: Window blind cord <BR>Garote: Blind cord, brown belt <BR>Death: The old bag trick and strangulation with clotes line rope. <BR>Clothed: White sweat shirt, green pants <BR>Comments: The threw up at one time. Had Rib injury from wreck few ? before, laying on coat. <BR> <BR>If you want to make comments about the items on this thread, please go to Otero murder reconstuction thanks<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8792-->
<!--Post: 9953--><!--Time: 1109712593-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9953"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 1:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok Charlie agreed with me on Larry King, he belives is families murders have nothing to do with the others, believe his father knew Rader from before finds it strange that they were in the Air Force at the same time, and does not believe Rader did all this by himself. Any Ideas?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9953-->
<!--Post: 12791--><!--Time: 1113234669-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12791"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 11, 2005 - 8:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I will proffer this with extreme caution and respect for Charlie and those who died. I was most concerned when I read Beattie&#39;s account of Joe&#39;s mistress and the lies that he told his family regarding his CIA position so he could spend overnights with his mistress. That requires some psychopathy in and of itself &#40;and we all possess this to some degree&#41;. Of course, a hot piece has made many a man lose his morals, common sense, and plan to dump his family for the other not so worn female. Charlie also stated that his father had an appointment and did not plan to return home that morning. Why did Otero return home? To take the other children to school? Once Charlie stated that they were ill. Yet, their lunches were being prepared. There are too many unanswered questions. I would want to know if he stayed in touch with the mistress after his move to Wichita. I do not know whether the police have or could even now follow that lead. Could he have been part of a plan that went very wrong and Rader went nuts? A trained, vicious guard dog, 4 people trained in the martial arts: someone had to be involved who disarmed everyones&#39; cautions and fears. They were completely taken off guard, with no hint of what was to come. Only the victims and the killer&#40;s&#41; know. If Rader did this alone, he is superman. Also Charlie stated that his mother&#39;s fingernails looked like she had clawed concrete. Beattie&#39;s book stated that her nails were perfect, indicating no defensive struggle. I hope Rader lives long enough to tell the facts behind these murders. Again, I am putting forth this cautiously and with no disrespect for Joe and the family. Of all the homicides, this is by far the most baffling and seemingly meaningless. If Rader was part of some plot, via Air Force activities, to hit Joe and his family, someone would have then hit Rader to eliminate the one link who might talk. I do not think that the facts will ever be completely told by the authorities should they be privy to all. Apologies for my thoughts. I am just trying to explore every possible scenario.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12791-->
<!--Post: 12793--><!--Time: 1113236248-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12793"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tulip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tulip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 11, 2005 - 9:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop, <BR> <BR>I have had many of these thoughts myself.  There are sooo many questions in this case, especially.   <BR> <BR>I would disagree with one thing.  You said, &#34;Of all the homicides, this is by far the most baffling and seemingly meaningless&#34;.  I disagree. This seems to be the most meaningful. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
